# Core rules

Read **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** first; it is the only project guide.

- **No secrets.** Never commit `.env`, API keys or credentials. The NASA key lives only in `NASA_API_KEY`.
- **Team members are minors.** No photos, video, voices or likenesses of under-18s. First names or nicknames only, with no personal data.
- **Cite sources.** Do not invent facts; mark gaps **UNVERIFIED**. Keep the repository private. Never force-push `main`; commit only when asked.
- `?demo=1` makes zero network requests. Contract changes need a row in `docs/contracts/CHANGES.md` and updated fixtures.
- Run `node --test web/tests/*.test.mjs` after changing `web/`.
